  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 10th level, the huay chooses one skin form set (such as Monstrous Physique or Fey Form). They no longer take essence burn when switching into skin forms from that set or switching to their Alter Self skin form. In addition, so long as they only shift into skin forms from their chosen set or Alter Self during their skin shift, they do not take essence burn when their skin shift ends.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
